    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/plugins/zamzam-post-grid-blocks.1.0.0.zip",
    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Zamzam Post Grid Blocks</strong> is a lightweight and powerful WordPress plugin that lets you display posts in beautiful grids using <strong>Gutenberg blocks</strong> with AJAX-powered features.</p>\n<p>You can build fully responsive post grids with <strong>AJAX Load More</strong>, and <strong>Pagination</strong> without writing any code. The plugin is optimized for performance and works seamlessly with any WordPress theme.</p>\n<p>Perfect for blogs, magazines, news sites, and portfolio websites.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/zamzam-post-grid-blocks</code> directory, or install the plugin directly from the WordPress plugins screen.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the <strong>Plugins</strong> screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Add <strong>Zamzam Post Grid Blocks</strong> block from the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20support%20ajax%20load%20more%3F\">\nDoes it support AJAX Load More?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the plugin supports AJAX Load More and Pagination.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20it%20gutenberg%20compatible%3F\">\nIs it Gutenberg compatible?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Absolutely. The plugin is built specifically for the Gutenberg block editor.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20it%20mobile%20responsive%3F\">\nIs it mobile responsive?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, all grids and layouts are fully responsive.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"will%20it%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F\">\nWill it work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Zamzam Post Grid Blocks works with all properly coded WordPress themes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20require%20jquery%3F\">\nDoes it require jQuery?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. The plugin is built using modern JavaScript practices.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Beautiful Gutenberg block to display posts in responsive grids, list, AJAX load more &amp; pagination. Lightweight &amp; customizable.",
    "description": "<p><strong>Zamzam Post Grid Blocks</strong> is a lightweight and powerful WordPress plugin that lets you display posts in beautiful grids using <strong>Gutenberg blocks</strong> with AJAX-powered features.</p>\n<p>You can build fully responsive post grids with <strong>AJAX Load More</strong>, and <strong>Pagination</strong> without writing any code. The plugin is optimized for performance and works seamlessly with any WordPress theme.</p>\n<p>Perfect for blogs, magazines, news sites, and portfolio websites.</p>\n",
